{"story_id":"KR-51002-049","title":"Who Decides, God or the King?","title_raw":"XLIX    WHO DECIDES, GOD OR THE KING?","notes":"","language":"en","original_language":"ko","country":"Korea","country_code":"KR","culture_region":"朝鮮半島","latitude":36.6,"longitude":127.9,"location_precision":"culture_region","map_location_type":"source_culture_region","collector":"Im Bang; Yi Ryuk","translator":"James S. Gale","publication_year":1913,"year_evidence":"扉に 1913(序文の署名は 1911)","book_id":"PG-51002","book_title":"Korean Folk Tales: Imps, Ghosts and Fairies","source_provider":"Project Gutenberg","source_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/51002","source_title":"Korean folk tales : $b Imps, ghosts and fairies","license_status":"PUBLIC_DOMAIN_US","license_name":"Public Domain (United States)","license_jurisdiction":"US","rights_evidence_url":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/51002","redistribution_allowed":true,"commercial_use":true,"derivative_use":true,"ml_processing_status":"reviewed","verification_date":"2026-09-08","word_count":223,"text":"King Tai-jong was having a rest in Heung-yang Palace, while outside\ntwo eunuchs were talking together over the law that governs the\naffairs of men, as to whether it is man or God. A said, \"Riches and\nhonour are all in the king's hand.\" B said, \"Nothing of the kind;\nevery atom of wealth and every degree of promotion are all ordered\nof God. Even the king himself has no part in it and no power.\"\n\nSo they argued, each that he was right, without ever coming to an\nagreement.\n\nThe King, overhearing what was said, wrote a secret despatch, saying,\n\"Raise the Bearer of this letter one degree in rank.\" He sealed it\nand commanded A to take it to Se-jong, who was then in charge of this\noffice. A made his bow and departed, but just when he was about to\nleave the palace enclosure a furious pain took him in the stomach,\nso that he begged B to take his place and go into the city.\n\nThe next day, when the record of promotions was placed before the King,\nhe read how B had been advanced, but not one word was there about A.\n\nKing Tai-jong made inquiry, and when he knew the circumstances he\ngave a sudden start of wonder and remained long in deep thought.\n\nYi Ryuk.\n\nL","cluster":5,"analysis":{"analysis_version":"1.0","embedding_model":"intfloat/multilingual-e5-small","themes":[],"motifs":[],"animals":[],"nature":[],"events":[{"position":0.0,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.091,"label":"Reward","hits":1,"lift":170.75,"method":"count"},{"position":0.182,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.273,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.364,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.455,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.545,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.636,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.727,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.818,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":0.909,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"},{"position":1.0,"label":null,"hits":0,"lift":0.0,"method":"count"}],"tension":[{"position":0.0,"tension":0.0,"raw":-5.556,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.091,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.182,"tension":0.0,"raw":-5.556,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.273,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.364,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.455,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.545,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.636,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.727,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.818,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":0.909,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"},{"position":1.0,"tension":1.0,"raw":0.0,"method":"lexicon"}],"charac